WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.845
Interviewer mode, in under a minute.

2
00:00:02.945 --> 00:00:06.945
How to run a case for a friend

3
00:00:07.095 --> 00:00:10.307
Read the prompt aloud, once

4
00:00:10.407 --> 00:00:13.592
Share facts and exhibits only when they ask for them.

5
00:00:13.692 --> 00:00:18.281
Push like a real interviewer: ask "so what?" and "what would you recommend?"

6
00:00:18.381 --> 00:00:21.205
Keep time: about 30 minutes

7
00:00:21.305 --> 00:00:25.046
At the end, score each stage, and give one thing to fix.

8
00:00:25.196 --> 00:00:30.420
Then swap roles. Being the interviewer teaches you what a strong answer looks like.
